---
import Section from '../ui/Section.astro';
---

<Section id="introduction" title="Iconify Picker">
  <p class="lead">
    An autonomous web component for selecting icons from <a href="https://iconify.design/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Iconify</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href="https://iconify.design/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Iconify</a> is an open source icon framework. It brings more than 200 icon sets, over 300,000 icons, into one API.
    This picker lets you search and select those icons in your own app, with no dependencies.
  </p>
</Section>

<style>
.lead {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  color: var(--tx1);
  margin: var(--s3) 0;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--acc);
  padding-left: var(--s0);
  font-style: italic;
}
</style>
